# The same app on glowcap and Goblins

One Racket application runs unchanged on glowcap's Racket binding and
[Spritely Goblins](https://spritely.institute/goblins/), timed head to head
across four small applications. The actors run in the Racket binding's vat;
this is not glowcap's native Zig actor runtime or a concurrent-load test.
“glowcap + time-travel” enables snapshot support but does not take snapshots.
The [benchmark methodology](https://github.com/jimisaacs/glowcap/blob/main/bench/goblins/METHODOLOGY.md)
explains what is held constant.

```=html
