# Time-travel: snapshot and restore

This sweep varies actor count and bytes per actor. glowcap and Goblins run on
different runtimes, so compare how cost scales with actor count rather than
their absolute times. The benchmark supports the expected O(objects) behavior;
source and tests establish the sharing mechanism.

